#. ja: 戦闘不能状態になり、メダルを落としました。<br>一定時間経過後にスタート地点に復活します。<br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>メダル所持数：<num $n1>　→　<num $n2></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Du bist kampfunfähig geworden und hast Medaillen verloren.<br>Warte einen Augenblick, bis du dem Kampf wieder beitreten kannst.<br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Medaillen in Besitz: <num $n1> → <num $n2></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Vous avez laissé tomber des médailles suite à un K.O.<br>Vous reprendrez le combat au point de départ dans quelques instants.<br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Médailles<nbsp>: <num $n1> → <num $n2></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Addon:5409:0:0"
msgid "You have been KO'd and lost medals (<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><num $n1> → <num $n2></ui-edge-color></ui-color>). <br>Returning to starting area shortly."
msgstr "Вы нокаутированы и потеряли медали: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><num $n1> → <num $n2></ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Скоро вы вернётесь на стартовую площадку."

