#. ja: 有効期限：<set-time $n1><num $year>/<num $month>/<num $day> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>
#. de: Gültig bis <set-time $n1><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>
#. fr: Validité<nbsp>: <set-time $n1><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>
#. macro: <set-time $n1> — sets the time placeholders ($hour, $day, …) to a Unix time; time = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $month> — a number; value = month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $day> — a number; value = day of the month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $year> — a number; value = year of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $hour> — a number; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num2 $min> — a number with at least two digits, such as 05; value = minutes of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "Addon:5602:0:0"
msgid "Deadline:  <set-time $n1><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year> <num $hour>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if>"
msgstr "Срок: <set-time $n1><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>"

#. ja: <if ($n2 >= 1)>「<string $s1>」のコンプリート条件を満たす。<br>（チャンスポイント+<num $n2>）<else>「<string $s1>」のコンプリート条件を満たす。</if>
#. de: <if ($n2 >= 1)>Schließe den Inhalt „<string $s1>“ ab.<br>(Du erhältst <num $n2> Chance-Punkt<if ($n2 == 1)><else>e</if>.) <else>Schließe den Inhalt „<string $s1>“ ab.</if>
#. fr: <if ($n2 >= 1)>Réussir “<string $s1>”<br>(Points de chance +<num $n2>)<else>Réussir “<string $s1>”</if>
#. macro: <if ($n2 >= 1)>Complete the following duty:<br><string $s0><br> (Second Chance Bonus: <num $n2> Points)<else>Complete the following duty:<br><string $s0></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 >= 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s0> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
