#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 > 0)>  You are not a Disciple of War or Magic.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
